# Root build-context ALLOWLIST. Two images build with the repo ROOT as their context:
#   - ops-controller (docker/ops-controller.Dockerfile: COPYs ordo/ catalog/ plugins/ agents/ dashboards/)
#   - worker         (worker/Dockerfile: COPYs worker/ + dashboard/ modules it imports)
# Everything else is excluded so the context stays tiny and no operator material
# (out/secrets.env, auth/caddy/certs/, data/, models/) can ever reach the daemon.
# (Subdirectory build contexts — docker/*/, hermes/, rag-ingestion/, … — are NOT
# affected: a .dockerignore only applies to the context directory it sits in.)
*
!ordo/
!catalog/
!plugins/
!agents/
!dashboards/
!dashboard/
!worker/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
